flowchart TB
  subgraph BACK[Processing boundary]
    direction LR
    subgraph HOST[Trusted host]
      direction TB
      A[Archive original<br/>Choose processor]
      C[Scoped capabilities<br/>read · write · transcribe]
      V[Validate manifest<br/>Save one publication]
      S[Host-owned storage<br/>Originals + artifact refs<br/>Selected search text]
      A --> C
      V --> S
    end
    subgraph WORKER[Untrusted Dynamic Worker]
      P[process input + host<br/>Creates bytes via capabilities<br/>No ambient network]
    end
    C -->|capability calls| P
    P -->|references + metadata| V
  end
  subgraph FRONT[Viewing boundary]
    direction LR
    U[Trusted host UI<br/>Search + readable fallback<br/>Scoped artifact broker]
    I[Optional untrusted iframe<br/>Opaque origin + sandbox + CSP]
    U <-->|MessagePort: artifact reads only| I
  end
  S --> U
